OSDUIHelper(8)              System Manager's Manual             OSDUIHelper(8)

NAME
     OSDUIHelper – OSDFramework UI helper.

DESCRIPTION
     OSDUIHelper UI Helper inside OSDFramework responsible for drawing on
     screen graphics such as volume/brightness up/down. This command is not
     intended to be invoked directly. Radar component is OSDFramework/X.

